       •  ssttrrttccppyy()

       •  ssttrrllccppyy(3bsd) and ssttrrllccaatt(3bsd) are similar, but have important per‐
          formance problems; see BUGS.

       •  ssttppnnccppyy(3)  and  ssttrrnnccppyy(3)  also  truncate,  but  they  don’t write
          strings, but rather null‐padded character sequences.

