       uuttmmppxx(5)  and ttaarr(1), use null‐padded character sequences in fixed‐size
       buffers.  To interface with them,  specialized  functions  need  to  be
       used.

       To  copy  bytes from strings into these buffers, use ssttrrnnccppyy(3) or ssttpp‐‐
       nnccppyy(3).

